{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1500949-lunar-new-year\u2019s-doodle-thread-water-rabbit-edition","id":1500949,"title":"Lunar New Year\u2019s Doodle Thread: Water Rabbit Edition","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-01-21T11:16:11-08:00","id":1500949,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon3.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Lunar New Year\u2019s Doodle Thread: Water Rabbit Edition","content":"<div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><img width=\"1800\" height=\"2428\" data-align=\"center\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/498704231407288320/1066431785019388044/IMG_2662.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/498704231407288320/1066431785019388044/IMG_2662.jpg\" data-thumb-url=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/498704231407288320/1066431785019388044/IMG_2662.jpg\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/></div><br /> <div align=\"center\"><br /> <b>Auspicious Midnight Eve Demetheus, Green Sun of the First Day Cearr</b></div> <hr /><br /> The forum is back just in time for T\u1ebft! So here\u2019s my Lunar New Year art thread for this year \ud83d\udc83<br /> <br /> If anyone happens to want a sketch of your character for this holiday then just post their description here, stuff like hair style, height, body type, typical facial expression,\u2026etc. It gonna be a T\u1ebft-theme sketches though so it probably all gonna be 99% \u00e1o d\u00e0i for their attire (\uff89 \u00b4 \u0437 `) \u30ce","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-21T17:00:38-08:00","id":1500974,"title":"","content":"Methinks ill just re-request Wu MA since I was too late last year...<br /> <br /> Wu Ma<br /> Fire Aspect Dragonblooded bandit turned exorcist<br /> Barrel chested and stocky<br /> Long reddish-black hair tied up in a top-knot<br /> Long reddish black beard<br /> Mix of Imperial and Varangi (almond eyes and somewhere between tanned and rust colored skin)<br /> Worn leather satchel of exorcism gear<br /> Ever-present drinking gourd<br /> Wields Zelator from Arms of the Chosen<br /> <br /> (Since I suck at descriptions, for much more relevant descriptions I picture him as a mix of Yin Chek Hsia from A Chinese Ghost Story, Fire Master from Deadful Melody, with a splash of the typical depiction of Guan Yu. And yes, the actor behind both characters is where I got the name)\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-22T12:32:42-08:00","id":1501045,"title":"","content":"Happy New Year, Jen! If you're looking for folks to sketch, I'd be honored if you chose any of my folks. I'm going to offer up 3 different folks. Have fun with whoever you end up choosing and enjoy the celebration!<br /> <br /> Kalara, you already know of her. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> She would absolutely LOVE all the sweets for this time of year, being quite the confectionary fiend. Ref/bio <a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/theuncrucified/702932444263940096/kalara-vadras-the-uncrucified-solar-exalted?source=share\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.<br /> <br /> <img width=\"700\" height=\"579\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/dd71cc3b54bfb58dd051803956405ed6/24a1a22628cf89e9-5c/s2048x3072/1d81e1a1a3076737706942964a647cdf95ab617e.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/dd71cc3b54bfb58dd051803956405ed6/24a1a22628cf89e9-5c/s2048x3072/1d81e1a1a3076737706942964a647cdf95ab617e.jpg\" data-thumb-url=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/dd71cc3b54bfb58dd051803956405ed6/24a1a22628cf89e9-5c/s2048x3072/1d81e1a1a3076737706942964a647cdf95ab617e.jpg\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> <br /> Night Locust, a prank-loving pacifist with deadly skills. One of Kalara's closest friends who is like a little brother to her. More ref/bio of him here.<br /> <br /> <img width=\"407\" height=\"600\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" 